      "product_summary": "Mens wide toe box lace-up walking sneakers with a jacquard textile upper, MD midsole and rubber-plastic outsole. Choose Black with a black midsole, or Beige and Light Gray with white midsoles; all have tan outsole sections. Each color is offered in EU39-46. Actual photographs show the upper weave, textile lace loops, rear pull tab, ribbed sidewall and outsole profile. Send color, pair quantity, EU size mix, packaging requirements and destination for a wholesale quotation. Sample availability, requested branding or packaging feasibility, charges and dispatch timing are confirmed for the requested order.",
